IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ELIGCALC.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-INCOME            PIC 9(7).
01  WS-HH-SIZE           PIC 9(2).
01  WS-LIMIT             PIC 9(7).
01  WS-ELIGIBLE          PIC X.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LOGIC.
    * Business rule: LIMIT = 18000 + (6000 * HH-SIZE)
    COMPUTE WS-LIMIT = 18000 + (6000 * WS-HH-SIZE)

    IF WS-INCOME <= WS-LIMIT
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-ELIGIBLE
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO WS-ELIGIBLE
    END-IF

    DISPLAY 'ELIGIBLE=' WS-ELIGIBLE
    STOP RUN.
